eurostat-lau-nuts-de-extract.xlsx
Source: Eurostat LAU-NUTS correspondence, EU-27-LAU-2025-NUTS-2024.xlsx, sheet DE: header
plus one row per hand-mapped key: 11000000 Berlin (the whole city as one LAU unit, direct
match for AGS 11000), 03159501 Harz gemeindefreies Geb. (direct match for AGS 03159501), and
one representative Gemeinde per remaining Kreis key (03159016 Goettingen Stadt for AGS 03159,
07135020 Cochem Stadt for AGS 07135, 07140144 Simmern/Huensrueck Stadt for AGS 07140).
Verified over the full DE sheet (11,268 rows, blank trailing rows excluded): 400 distinct
5-digit Kreis prefixes and 400 distinct NUTS3 codes, in exact bijection (no Kreis maps to two
NUTS3 codes or vice versa) for this NUTS 2024 / LAU 2025 version specifically. Germany's own
row is marked "validated" in the file's Overview sheet across every column (NUTS3, DEGURBA,
coastal area, city, FUA); among all EU-27 countries only Cyprus carries a partial-validation
caveat there (FUAs use 2018 commuting data), non-EU candidate countries are unvalidated, and
every EU-27 country including DE is otherwise validated.
